	(text_box "Power:\n\nConnector taps the car's control board to feed 24V to 5V bucks converters. \n\nEverything is 5V tolerant except:\nMust use 5V_{IN} for ESP32\nMust use 3V3 from ESP32 for voltage buffer pull-ups\n\nHY2500RX"
